  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 24 × 12 - 6 ÷ 40 + 20 = 28.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) - and +\n\nGiven: 24 × 12 - 6 ÷ 40 + 20 = 28\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 × 12 + __**6 ÷ 40**__ - 20 = 28\n\n⇒ __**24 × 12**__ + 0.15 - 20 = 28\n\n⇒ __**288 + 0.15**__ - 20 = 28\n\n⇒ __288.15 - 20__ = 28\n\n⇒ 268.15 ≠ 28\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) ÷ and -**\n\nGiven: 24 × 12 - 6 ÷ 40 + 20 = 28\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 × __**12 ÷ 6**__ - 40 + 20 = 28\n\n⇒ __**24 × 2**__ - 40 + 20 = 28\n\n⇒ __**48**__ - 40 __**+ 20**__ = 28\n\n⇒ __68** - 40**__ = 28\n\n⇒ **28 = 28**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) + and × \n\nGiven: 24 × 12 - 6 ÷ 40 + 20 = 28\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 + 12 - __**6 ÷ 40**__ × 20 = 28\n\n⇒ 24 + 12 - __**0.15 × 20**__ = 28\n\n⇒ __**24 + 12**__ - 3 = 28\n\n⇒ __36 - 3__ = 28\n\n⇒ 33 ≠ 28\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) + and ÷ \n\nGiven: 24 × 12 - 6 ÷ 40 + 20 = 28\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 24 × 12 - 6 + __**40 ÷ 20**__ = 28\n\n⇒ __**24 × 12**__ - 6 + 2 = 28\n\n⇒ __**288**__ - 6 __**+ 2**__ = 28\n\n⇒ __290____ - 6__ = 28\n\n⇒ 284 ≠ 28\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
